ff;border-color:var(--line);\"><h3 style=\"color:var(--ul-green-heritage);margin:0 0 .5rem;\">Three to six months</h3><p style=\"margin:0;color:var(--ink-70);\">Long enough to onboard, take ownership and deliver — across up to five residencies per student.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"ise-card\" style=\"background:#fff;border-color:var(--line);\"><h3 style=\"color:var(--ul-green-heritage);margin:0 0 .5rem;\">Fully supported</h3><p style=\"margin:0;color:var(--ink-70);\">Academic mentors and a learning framework wrap around every placement, sharing the load with your team.</p></div>\n  </div>\n</div></div>"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "4fdf042", "elType": "section", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "gap": "no", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "structure": "10"}, "elements": [{"id": "524ba27", "elType": "column", "settings": {"_column_size": 100, "_inline_size": null, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}}, "elements": [{"id": "7ebd656", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"ise-band\" style=\"padding-block:var(--section-y);\">\n<div class=\"ise-container\">\n  <div style=\"max-width:54ch;margin-bottom:2.25rem;\">\n    <p class=\"ise-eyebrow\">Why partner with ISE</p>\n    <h2>Meet exceptional engineers before anyone else</h2>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1.5rem;\">\n    <div class=\"ise-card\" style=\"background:#fff;border-color:var(--line);\"><h3 style=\"color:var(--ul-green-heritage);margin:0 0 .5rem;\">Access talent early</h3><p style=\"margin:0;color:var(--ink-70);\">Work with a highly selective cohort years before they reach the graduate market.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"ise-card\" style=\"background:#fff;border-color:var(--line);\"><h3 style=\"color:var(--ul-green-heritage);margin:0 0 .5rem;\">Build your pipeline</h3><p style=\"margin:0;color:var(--ink-70);\">Residencies are the strongest possible route to hiring — you have already worked together.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"ise-card\" style=\"background:#fff;border-color:var(--line);\"><h3 style=\"color:var(--ul-green-heritage);margin:0 0 .5rem;\">Fresh capability</h3><p style=\"margin:0;color:var(--ink-70);\">Motivated students bring current skills, energy and new perspectives to your team.</p></div>\n  </div>\n  <blockquote style=\"margin:2.5rem 0 0;padding:0;border:0;\">\n    <p class=\"ise-serif\" style=\"font-size:clamp(1.3rem,2.4vw,1.9rem);color:var(--ul-green-heritage);max-width:40ch;margin:0;line-height:1.3;\">“Software engineering is a wonderful career.”</p>\n    <footer style=\"font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:1rem;color:var(--ink-70);margin-top:.75rem;\">John Collison · co-founder, Stripe</footer>\n  </blockquote>\n</div></div>"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "9f83e8a", "elType": "section", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "gap": "no", "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "structure": "10"}, "elements": [{"id": "ff377a8", "elType": "column", "settings": {"_column_size": 100, "_inline_size": null, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}}, "elements": [{"id": "b6db544", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"ise-band--green\" style=\"padding-block:var(--section-y);\">\n<div class=\"ise-container\" style=\"text-align:center;max-width:760px;\">\n  <h2 style=\"color:#fff;\">Become a residency p